<title>CHILE: Chilean markets closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Chilean markets closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banks, businesses, government offices and the Santiago Stock Exchange were all closed in Chile on Friday for the All Saints Day holiday.</p>
<p>Activity will return to normal Monday.</p>
<p>--Santiago newsroom +56-2-672-8800</p>
</text>
